      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p class="MsoNormal">Line 56- The Net Increase in Debt (Long Term Advances) of $11,700,000.00 received in the First Quarter of 2026, represents a Capital Contribution of cash from Vector&#8217;s Partners (as shown in Line 56.2).&#160; This funding is specifically earmarked for payment of Capital expenditure related invoices due to be paid during the Second Quarter of 2026.&#160; This is not a Long Term Advance.</p>
      </div>
