      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>
          <span style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;">For the period ending March 31st, 2025, the 2025 current tax provision of $7,713,285 was relieved through the retained earnings account.</span>
